<title>[CORRECTED 10:48 GMT 9/11] UK: All four Brent Nov 23-27 dates kept on Friday.</title>
<headline>48 GMT 9/11] UK: All four Brent Nov 23-27 dates kept on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BP kept two of the four sets of Brent dates nominated down the paper chains on Friday while Statoil and Mobil kept one each, traders said (corrects to show Statoil did not keep two Brents).</p>
<p>The four cargoes will load in the Nov 23-27 window.</p>
<p>-- Kate Dourian, London newsroom +44 171 542 4095</p>
</text>
